<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Prompt</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="276.01" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 276.01" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,276.01) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 270.11 C 0 273.37 2.64 276.01 5.91 276.01 L 647.24 276.01 C 650.51 276.01 653.15 273.37 653.15 270.11 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 254.59 L 651.18 254.59 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 260.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.32em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="530.24"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.32em;">
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">COT for Summarization</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:16.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="229.01" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 225.55)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"Below is the original document:"</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{reference}</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"Below is a summary of the document:"</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{response}</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"Your task is to determine whether the summary contains hallucinations."
"First, provide reasoning with the following format:"</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">## Step 1: <math id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math> your first reasoning step <math id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">## Step 2: <math id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math> your next reasoning step <math id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">…(add as many steps as needed)
Then, compile the labeled hallucinated spans into a JSON dict, with a key hallucination list and its value is a list of hallucinated spans. If there are potential hallucinations, the output should be in the following JSON format: hallucination list: [hallucination span1, hallucination span2, …]. Otherwise, leave the value as an empty list as follows: hallucination list: [].</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
